    lmline:|-h:|--help:) usage ;;
    doctor:) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline doctor [--check-api]

Check local lmline configuration, installed defaults, command dependencies,
profiles, and clipboard provider state. `--check-api` also calls the configured
model catalog.
EOF
