MODE is generate, rewrite, explain, fix, or clip.
EOF
      ;;
    sandbox:) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline sandbox setup [options]
       lmline sandbox run [options] -- COMMAND
       lmline sandbox check

Manage and use the microsandbox CLI execution backend.
EOF
      ;;
    sandbox:setup) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline sandbox setup [--name NAME] [--image IMAGE] [--workspace readonly|writable|none] [--root PATH] [--workdir PATH] [--timeout SECONDS]

Create or reuse a named project sandbox, mount the project at the guest workdir,
