      ;;
    history:show) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline history show

Show recorded lmline suggestion entries.
EOF
      ;;
    history:tendencies) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline history tendencies

Summarize recorded suggestion modes.
EOF
      ;;
    risk:) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline risk COMMAND...

Classify a command with the configured risk policy.
EOF
      ;;
    help:) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline help [TOPIC...]

Print lmline CLI help. TOPIC may be a command, subcommand, or payload mode,
for example `lmline help sandbox run` or `lmline help config describe`.
EOF
      ;;
    debug:) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline debug bindings
       lmline debug on
       lmline debug off
       lmline debug trace on|off

Inspect bindings or toggle debug and trace settings.
EOF
      ;;
    debug:bindings) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline debug bindings

Print active Bash Readline bindings that call lmline widgets.
EOF
      ;;
    debug:on) cat <<'EOF'
usage: lmline debug on

Enable verbose status logging.
EOF
      ;;
    debug:off) cat <<'EOF'
